  "$comment_pals": "One DISTINCT rigged creature per species (Quaternius, via poly.pizza; see fetch-assets PIZZA list). `clips` maps game verbs to exact AnimationGroup names in each GLB; null means the model lacks the verb and the procedural pose layer covers it. `scale` is applied at instantiation; creature GLBs are authored 1-2m tall and species read comes from the model itself now, so species.json tint/accessory become optional garnish. yOffset lifts flyers/swimmers off the ground."
}